{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>משא מדבר ים.</b> It is Babylon, for this burden is upon it, and it is west opposite Persia and Media, or its meaning is ים in its literal sense:" "<b>לחלוף.</b> Like לעבור." "<b>ממדבר בא.</b> The enemy, and not from the sea." "<b>ומארץ נוראה.</b> The land of Media and Persia."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:25.786035459Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}